# Implementation Plan: QuickPrint — Online Printing Web App

QuickPrint is a modern, responsive web application designed for campus print shops, cyber cafes, and commercial printing centers. Customers can scan a shop's QR code at the counter, upload multiple files (PDF, images, documents), customize print settings (B&W/Color, paper size, duplex, page range, binding, lamination), see real-time price calculations, pay securely online, and track their print job in real time. Print shop owners get a live admin dashboard with sound alerts, one-click print status workflow, custom pricing configuration, and printable QR standee generation.

